<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 649 0 R/Alt(Two panels, one per class of system, each with the six laws along the horizontal axis and the stress error in dB from 2 to 16 on the vertical axis. Each law has three markers: a filled blue circle with a solid bar for the linear structure, an open green square with a dashed bar for the realistic size, an open orange triangle with a dotted bar for the strong size. Left, more control gauges than shakers: pinv_closed, pinv_open, shape_svd, buzz_match and band_average lie between about 3 and 5.3 dB at every stage; min_drive sits near 8.4, 8.5 and 10 dB. The strong-size triangles of pinv_closed, pinv_open, buzz_match and band_average are above their circles; shape_svd's is below. Right, square systems: pinv_closed, pinv_open and buzz_match lie between about 10 and 15 dB; min_drive at 6, 7.7 and 12 dB; shape_svd and band_average between about 2.9 and 5.8 dB, band_average's strong-size triangle at 5.8 the highest of its three.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 1340 0 R>>
endobj
