1003 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 1004 0 R/Alt(Two panels, the 6 x 12 system on the left and the 6 x 6 system on the right, each with the six laws along the horizontal axis and the change in stress error in dB from about minus 3 to plus 5 on the vertical axis, with a grey band from minus 0.2 to 0.2. Each law has three markers: a filled blue circle with a solid bar for both effects, an open orange square with a dashed bar for softening only, an open purple diamond with a dotted bar for hardening only. Left: the circles and squares of pinv_closed, pinv_open, buzz_match, min_drive and band_average lie between about 0.6 and 2 dB, shape_svd's near minus 0.7; every diamond lies on the grey band. Right: min_drive's circle and square near 4.4 and 3.7 dB, band_average's near 2.7 and 1.8, pinv_closed's near minus 1.7 and minus 1.6, the others between about minus 0.7 and 0.9; the diamonds lie near zero except min_drive's at minus 1.3 and pinv_open's at minus 0.4.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[33]/Pg 1344 0 R>>
endobj
